Preamble

This software is for the people. It exists to make AI more accessible —
free for anyone to use, study, improve, and share. One rule protects
that: it stays free. No one may sell it or make money from it, and
every copy carries these same terms, so the next person always gets
the same deal you did.

The preamble states intent and does not limit the terms below.

